That's a much richer prediction.

This is where research is going

Recent clinical transformer models have evolved beyond Med-BERT to capture richer temporal information, including models such as:

BEHRT
CEHR-BERT
G-BERT
MedGPT

Many newer systems combine diagnoses, medications, laboratory values, procedures, and timestamps rather than treating diagnoses alone as the input.

